{"id":"proshloe","lemma":"прошлое","pos":"noun","rank":883,"glosses":["the past"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/24/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"прошлого","plural":"прошлые"},"examples":[{"text":"Прошлое есть прошлое.","en":"The past is the past.","words":[null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Что ты помнишь из прошлого вечера?","en":"What do you remember from last night?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,{"g":"evening","l":"вечер"}]},{"text":"Я хочу забыть прошлое.","en":"I want to forget the past.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to forget"},null]},{"text":"Мне нет дела до вашего прошлого.","en":"I don't care about your past.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"деть"},{"g":"until / before"},{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null]},{"text":"Мы не можем изменить прошлое.","en":"We can't change the past.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to change"},null]}]}